{"nodes": [{"id": "template_starter_claude_starter_template", "label": "Simatrix Starter Template", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "template_starter/CLAUDE.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The stripped, platform-only boilerplate a new subject module (Case C) duplicates. Minted from the Module 2 master with all Engineering-Graphics domain content stripped. Deliberately silent on EG-specific architecture so a new discipline decides and documents its own; ships an empty rebuild() pipeline, working stepper, Compare scaffolding, simAPI, meta.json, fonts, boot watchdog and mobile notice, and nothing subject-specific."}, {"id": "template_starter_claude_platform_wide_contract", "label": "Platform-Wide Contract", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "template_starter/CLAUDE.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The only documentation a new subject inherits automatically (the template plus PLATFORM-RULES.md); everything else about how the module is built is the author's to decide and record before writing simulation code."}, {"id": "template_starter_claude_window_simapi", "label": "window.simAPI Host Contract", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "template_starter/CLAUDE.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Exposes pause()/resume()/reset(); the in-sim Reset is the only reset path (simAPI.reset()). Host-embed contract chosen over postMessage (ADR-002)."}, {"id": "template_starter_claude_meta_json", "label": "meta.json (four required fields)", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "template_starter/CLAUDE.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "title / description / difficulty / tags; the platform rejects an upload missing any field, and difficulty must be lowercase."}, {"id": "template_starter_claude_rebuild_pipeline", "label": "rebuild() State-Change Pipeline", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "template_starter/CLAUDE.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "One disciplined path from 'the learner changed something' to 'the scene reflects it'. Ships empty but already runs the disposal/cleanup contract. A single path keeps state flow from drifting and avoids WebGL context exhaustion."}, {"id": "template_starter_claude_module_local_docs", "label": "Module-Local ARCHITECTURE / DECISIONS / RULES", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "template_starter/CLAUDE.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "New files each subject module writes for itself before writing simulation code (not the EG-specific root copies). An undocumented architecture is exactly what lets a module drift from itself as it grows; ADR numbering restarts at ADR-001."}, {"id": "template_starter_claude_platform_rules", "label": "PLATFORM-RULES.md", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "template_starter/CLAUDE.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The subject-agnostic enforcement checklist every Simatrix module must follow; a module's own RULES.md is written on top of it as its stated foundation, never duplicating or contradicting it."}, {"id": "template_starter_claude_design_md", "label": "DESIGN.md (platform design system)", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "template_starter/CLAUDE.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The single platform-wide design system (color tokens, typography, component standards). Modules consume its tokens and must never hard-code design values or carry a local copy."}, {"id": "template_starter_claude_product_md", "label": "PRODUCT.md (platform product contract)", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "template_starter/CLAUDE.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The single platform-wide product contract: personas, design principles, anti-references, and accessibility commitments."}, {"id": "template_starter_claude_session_digest_protocol", "label": "Session Digest Protocol", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "template_starter/CLAUDE.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "End-of-session digest (what changed, decisions, patterns introduced, open questions, files modified) that feeds the keep-your-own-documents-current discipline."}, {"id": "template_starter_claude_scope_boundary", "label": "Scope Boundary (self-contained sim payload)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "template_starter/CLAUDE.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The module produces only the viewport plus its dock/controls/hints; the host website chrome (navbar, browser, account, marketing) is out of scope. Treat the sim as a teaching aid embedded in someone else's page and never render navigation, branding, or footer inside its iframe."}, {"id": "template_starter_claude_platform_visual_rules", "label": "Platform Visual Rules (Quiet Chrome, Chrome-Only Blue, Two-Cue, Two-Weight, Tabular, Flat-Ink, Border-Over-Shadow)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "template_starter/CLAUDE.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The platform's named, subject-agnostic viewport/chrome encodings that still apply to any new discipline; domain-specific meaning is layered on top, never by redefining a shared token."}, {"id": "template_starter_claude_mobile_notice", "label": "Dismissible Mobile Notice (<768px)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "template_starter/CLAUDE.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A 'Best experienced on desktop' banner shown below 768px that advises but never blocks the sim; part of the platform runtime contract."}], "edges": [{"source": "template_starter_claude_starter_template", "target": "template_starter_readme_module_starter_playbook", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "template_starter/CLAUDE.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "template_starter_claude_starter_template", "target": "template_starter_claude_platform_wide_contract", "relation": "implements", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "template_starter/CLAUDE.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "template_starter_claude_starter_template", "target": "template_starter_readme_case_c", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "template_starter/CLAUDE.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "template_starter_claude_starter_template", "target": "template_starter_claude_window_simapi", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "template_starter/CLAUDE.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "template_starter_claude_starter_template", "target": "template_starter_claude_meta_json", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "template_starter/CLAUDE.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "template_starter_claude_starter_template", "target": "template_starter_claude_rebuild_pipeline", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "template_starte